{"5019350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR", "steam_appid": 5019350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK IT. STEAL IT. ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pony is a rebellious teenage girl looking for somewhere to blow off all her pent-up stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR</strong>, she charges through maze-like space facilities, breaking hostile machines and anything else that happens to get in her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking things feels good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is that the Space Police are following the trail of destruction Pony leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the exit, climb to the next level, and keep moving before the pursuit catches up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/296fc4bb0dc14ed5cdff2a4e3d65c33d.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/296fc4bb0dc14ed5cdff2a4e3d65c33d.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/296fc4bb0dc14ed5cdff2a4e3d65c33d.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BROKEN UNIVERSE IS YOUR PLAYGROUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, machines, and objects scattered throughout the station are all part of Pony’s playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break whatever gets in your way, clear a path through the chaos, or simply enjoy the satisfying moment when one more piece of the universe stops working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Pony, destruction is more than a way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is how she blows off steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/b8709314d0fbb60332f115112c395b62.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/b8709314d0fbb60332f115112c395b62.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/b8709314d0fbb60332f115112c395b62.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK THEM. TAKE THEIR POWER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking a monster is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once an enemy enters a broken state, Pony can rip out one of its signature parts and transform it into a powerful <strong>single-use skill</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire the stolen ability straight back at its former owner. Save it for a tougher enemy. Or unleash it to wipe out whatever is blocking the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stolen skill can only be used once, so each one creates a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you steal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When will you use it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what might be waiting in the next room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/a3dfdd71fe09eb1500ac0980ad56d4d8.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/a3dfdd71fe09eb1500ac0980ad56d4d8.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/a3dfdd71fe09eb1500ac0980ad56d4d8.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR WAY. GET STRONGER. ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a maze, with an exit hidden somewhere ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the facility, hunt down monsters with useful abilities, and prepare more powerful skills for the dangers to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the longer you stay, the greater the risk becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Space Police are determined to stop Pony’s rampage, pursuing her along the path she has already taken. The more time she spends enjoying the destruction, the closer they get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you keep exploring in search of a stronger skill, or race toward the exit with whatever power you already have?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOO STRONG? STEAL SOMETHING STRONGER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies are too dangerous to defeat through ordinary attacks alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When something powerful blocks the way, Pony does not have to fight fairly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find another machine. Break it. Steal its strongest part. Then turn that power against the enemy that stopped you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A difficult encounter can become an explosive reversal once the right ability falls into Pony’s hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger the machines become, the more destructive the skills she can take from them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SMALL UNIVERSE BUILT FOR BIG TROUBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR</strong> combines stylish 3D action, miniature sci-fi environments, maze-like levels, destructible machines, and a pursuit that becomes more dangerous the longer you stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before the Space Police catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cause Chaos. Get Stronger. Escape the Error.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK IT. STEAL IT. ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pony is a rebellious teenage girl looking for somewhere to blow off all her pent-up stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR</strong>, she charges through maze-like space facilities, breaking hostile machines and anything else