kills for the dangers to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the longer you stay, the greater the risk becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Space Police are determined to stop Pony’s rampage, pursuing her along the path she has already taken. The more time she spends enjoying the destruction, the closer they get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you keep exploring in search of a stronger skill, or race toward the exit with whatever power you already have?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/d4c4bd9afc18cc631329dfb97f7de49a.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOO STRONG? STEAL SOMETHING STRONGER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies are too dangerous to defeat through ordinary attacks alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When something powerful blocks the way, Pony does not have to fight fairly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find another machine. Break it. Steal its strongest part. Then turn that power against the enemy that stopped you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A difficult encounter can become an explosive reversal once the right ability falls into Pony’s hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger the machines become, the more destructive the skills she can take from them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.poster.avif?t=1788245217\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.webm?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/extras/1609169d41febcfc78b41cb88820f61e.mp4?t=1788245217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SMALL UNIVERSE BUILT FOR BIG TROUBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR</strong> combines stylish 3D action, miniature sci-fi environments, maze-like levels, destructible machines, and a pursuit that becomes more dangerous the longer you stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before the Space Police catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cause Chaos. Get Stronger. Escape the Error.</strong></p>", "short_description": "HIGHPONY: SPACE ERROR follows Pony, a rebellious teenage girl who turns the universe into one big trail of trouble to blow off steam. Break machines and objects to your heart’s content, steal monster parts, and escape maze-like space facilities in this stylish 3D action adventure.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/d5db0c6b5c34eaef0775d78f44fa80ce46d2b647/header.jpg?t=1788245217", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/ff8a4b495f58d0c4646c96a8ce24ac2a73ffe125/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788245217", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019350/ff8a4b495f58d0c4646c96a8ce24ac2a73ffe125/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788245217", "website": "http://nararastudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: